<h1>The triple lock: how annual increases work</h1>

<p class="lede">Each April the full rates of the State Pension rise by the highest of three figures: the rise in prices, the rise in average earnings, or 2.5%. This page explains where the three figures come from, what the law requires, and what happened in each year.</p>

